ent kernel with wire-mode support (experimental)\nL605:   * Auth: Fix OAuth token refresh conflicts when running multiple sessions simultaneously\nL606:   * Web: Add file mention menu (`@`) to reference uploaded attachments and workspace files with autocomplete\nL607:   * Web: Add slash command menu in chat input with autocomplete, keyboard navigation, and alias support\nL608:   * Web: Prompt to create directory when specified path doesn't exist during session creation\nL609:   * Web: Fix authentication token persistence by switching from sessionStorage to localStorage with 24-hour expiry\nL610:   * Web: Add server-side pagination for session list with virtualized scrolling for better performance\nL611:   * Web: Improve session and work directories loading with smarter caching and invalidation\nL612:   * Web: Fix WebSocket errors during history replay by checking connection state before sending\nL613:   * Web: Git diff status bar now shows untracked files (new files not yet added to git)\nL614:   * Web: Restrict sensitive APIs only in public mode; update origin enforcement logic\nL615: ## 1.6 (2026-02-03)\nL616:   * Web: Add token-based authentication and access control for network mode (`--network`, `--lan-only`, `--public`)\nL617:   * Web: Add security options: `--auth-token`, `--allowed-origins`, `--restrict-sensitive-apis`, `--dangerously-omit-auth`\nL618:   * Web: Change `--host` option to bind to specific IP address; add automatic network address detection\nL619:   * Web: Fix WebSocket disconnect when creating new sessions\nL620:   * Web: Increase maximum image dimension from 1024 to 4096 pixels\nL621:   * Web: Improve UI responsiveness with enhanced hover effects and better layout handling\nL622:   * Wire: Add `TurnEnd` event to signal the completion of an agent turn (protocol version 1.2)\nL623:   * Core: Fix custom agent prompt files containing `$` causing silent startup failure\nL624: ## 1.5 (2026-01-30)\nL625: \nL626:   * Web: Add Git diff status bar showing uncommitted changes in session working directory\nL627:   * Web: Add \"Open in\" menu for opening files/directories in Terminal, VS Code, Cursor, or other local applications\nL628:   * Web: Add search functionality to filter sessions by title or working directory\nL629:   * Web: Improve session title display with proper overflow handling\nL630: ## 1.4 (2026-01-30)\nL631:   * Shell: Merge `/login` and `/setup` commands; `/setup` is now an alias for `/login`\nL632:   * Shell: `/usage` now shows remaining quota percentage; add `/status` alias\nL633:   * Config: Add `KIMI_SHARE_DIR` environment variable to customize the share directory path (default: `~/.kimi`)\nL634:   * Web: Add new Web UI for browser-based interaction\nL635:   * CLI: Add `kimi web` subcommand to launch the Web UI server\nL636:   * Auth: Fix encoding error when device name or OS version contains non-ASCII characters\nL637:   * Auth: OAuth credentials are now stored in files instead of keyring; existing tokens are automatically migrated on startup\nL638:   * Auth: Fix authorization failure after the system sleeps or hibernates\nL639: ## 1.3 (2026-01-28)\nL640: \nL641:   * Auth: Fix authentication issue during agent turns\nL642:   * Tool: Wrap media content with descriptive tags in `ReadMediaFile` for better path traceability\nL643: \nL644: ## 1.2 (2026-01-27)\nL645: \nL646:   * UI: Show description for `kimi-for-coding` model\nL647: \nL648: ## 1.1 (2026-01-27)\nL649: \nL650:   * LLM: Fix `kimi-for-coding` model's capabilities\nL651: ## 1.0 (2026-01-27)\nL652: \nL653:   * Shell: Add `/login` and `/logout` slash commands for login and logout\nL654:   * CLI: Add `kimi login` and `kimi logout` subcommands\nL655:   * Core: Fix subagent approval request handling\nL656: \nL657: ## 0.88 (2026-01-26)\nL658: \nL659:   * MCP: Remove `Mcp-Session-Id` header when connecting to MCP servers to fix compatibility\nL660: ## 0.87 (2026-01-25)\nL661: \nL662:   * Shell: Fix Markdown rendering error when HTML blocks appear outside any element\nL663:   * Skills: Add more user-level and project-level skills directory candidates\nL664:   * Core: Improve system prompt guidance for media file generation and processing tasks\nL665:   * Shell: Fix image pasting from clipboard on macOS\nL666: \nL667: ## 0.86 (2026-01-24)\nL668: \nL669:   * Build: Fix binary builds\nL670: ## 0.85 (2026-01-24)\nL671:   * Shell: Cache pasted images to disk for persistence across sessions\nL672:   * Shell: Deduplicate cached attachments based on content hash\nL673:   * Shell: Fix display of image/audio/video attachments in message history\nL674:   * Tool: Use file path as media identifier in `ReadMediaFile` for better traceability\nL675:   * Tool: Fix some MP4 files not being recognized as videos\nL676:   * Shell: Handle Ctrl-C during slash command execution\nL677:   * Shell: Fix shlex parsing error in shell mode when input contains invalid shell syntax\nL678:   * Shell: Fix stderr output from MCP servers and third-party libraries polluting shell UI\nL679:   * Wire: Graceful shutdown with proper cleanup of pending requests when connection closes or Ctrl-C is received\nL680: ## 0.84 (2026-01-22)\nL681:   * Build: Add cross-platform standalone binary builds for Windows, macOS (with code signing and notarization), and Linux (x86_64 and ARM64)\nL682:   * Shell: Fix slash command autocomplete showing suggestions for exact command/alias matches\nL683:   * Tool: Treat SVG files as text instead of images\nL684:   * Flow: Support D2 markdown block strings (`|md` syntax) for multiline node labels in flow skills\nL685:   * Core: Fix possible \"event loop is closed\" error after running `/reload`, `/setup`, or `/clear`\nL686:   * Core: Fix panic when `/clear` is used in a continued session\nL687: ## 0.83 (2026-01-21)\nL688: \nL689:   * Tool: Add `ReadMediaFile` tool for reading image/video files; `ReadFile` now focuses on text files only\nL690:   * Skills: Flow skills now also register as `/skill:<skill-name>` commands (in addition to `/flow:<skill-name>`)\nL691: ## 0.82 (2026-01-21)\nL692: \nL693:   * Tool: Allow `WriteFile` and `StrReplaceFile` tools to edit/write files outside the working directory when using absolute paths\nL694:   * Tool: Upload videos to Kimi files API when using Kimi provider, replacing inline data URLs with `ms://` references\nL695:   * Config: Add `reserved_context_size` setting to customize auto-compaction trigger threshold (default: 50000 tokens)\nL696: ## 0.81 (2026-01-21)\nL697: \nL698:   * Skills: Add flow skill type with embedded Agent Flow (Mermaid/D2) in SKILL.md, invoked via `/flow:<skill-name>` commands\nL699:   * CLI: Remove `--prompt-flow` option; use flow skills instead\nL700:   * Core: Replace `/begin` command with `/flow:<skill-name>` commands for flow skills\nL701: ## 0.80 (2026-01-20)\nL702: \nL703:   * Wire: Add `initialize` method for exchanging client/server info, external tools registration and slash commands advertisement\nL704:   * Wire: Support external tool calls via Wire protocol\nL705:   * Wire: Rename `ApprovalRequestResolved` to `ApprovalResponse` (backwards-compatible)\nL706: ## 0.79 (2026-01-19)\nL707:   * Skills: Add project-level skills support, discovered from `.agents/skills/` (or `.kimi/skills/`, `.claude/skills/`)\nL708:   * Skills: Unified skills discovery with layered loading (builtin → user → project); user-level skills now prefer `~/.config/agents/skills/`\nL709:   * Shell: Support fuzzy matching for slash command autocomplete\nL710:   * Shell: Enhanced approval request preview with shell command and diff content display, use `Ctrl-E` to expand full content\nL711:   * Wire: Add `ShellDisplayBlock` type for shell command display in approval requests\nL712:   * Shell: Reorder `/help` to show keyboard shortcuts before slash commands\nL713:   * Wire: Return proper JSON-RPC 2.0 error responses for invalid requests\nL714: ## 0.78 (2026-01-16)\nL715: \nL716:   * CLI: Add D2 flowchart format support for Prompt Flow (`.d2` extension)\nL717: ## 0.77 (2026-01-15)\nL718:   * Shell: Fix line breaking in `/help` and `/changelog` fullscreen pager display\nL719:   * Shell: Use `/model` to toggle thinking mode instead of Tab key\nL720:   * Config: Add `default_thinking` config option (need to run `/model` to select thinking mode after upgrade)\nL721:   * LLM: Add `always_thinking` capability for models that always use thinking mode\nL722:   * CLI: Rename `--command`/`-c` to `--prompt`/`-p`, keep `--command`/`-c` as alias, remove `--query`/`-q`\nL723:   * Wire: Fix approval requests not responding properly in Wire mode\nL724:   * CLI: Add `--prompt-flow` option to load a Mermaid flowchart file as a Prompt Flow\nL725:   * Core: Add `/begin` slash command if a Prompt Flow is loaded to start the flow\nL726:   * Core: Replace Ralph Loop with Prompt Flow-based implementation\nL727: ## 0.76 (2026-01-12)\nL728:   * Tool: Make `ReadFile` tool description reflect model capabilities for image/video support\nL729:   * Tool: Fix TypeScript files (`.ts`, `.tsx`, `.mts`, `.cts`) being misidentified as video files\nL730:   * Shell: Allow slash commands (`/help`, `/exit`, `/version`, `/changelog`, `/feedback`) in shell mode\nL731:   * Shell: Improve `/help` with fullscreen pager, showing slash commands, skills, and keyboard shortcuts\nL732:   * Shell: Improve `/changelog` and `/mcp` display with consistent bullet-style formatting\nL733:   * Shell: Show current model name in the bottom status bar\nL734:   * Shell: Add `Ctrl-/` shortcut to show help\nL735: ## 0.75 (2026-01-09)\nL736: \nL737:   * Tool: Improve `ReadFile` tool description\nL738:   * Skills: Add built-in `kimi-cli-help` skill to answer Kimi Code CLI usage and configuration questions\nL739: \nL740: ## 0.74 (2026-01-09)\nL741: \nL742:   * ACP: Allow ACP clients to select and switch models (with thinking variants)\nL743:   * ACP: Add `terminal-auth` authentication method for setup flow\nL744:   * CLI: Deprecate `--acp` option in favor of `kimi acp` subcommand\nL745:   * Tool: Support reading image and video files in `ReadFile` tool\nL746: ## 0.73 (2026-01-09)\nL747:   * Skills: Add built-in skill-creator skill shipped with the package\nL748:   * Tool: Expand `~` to the home directory in `ReadFile` paths\nL749:   * MCP: Ensure MCP tools finish loading before starting the agent loop\nL750:   * Wire: Fix Wire mode failing to accept valid `cancel` requests\nL751:   * Setup: Allow `/model` to switch between all available models for the selected provider\nL752:   * Lib: Re-export all Wire message types from `kimi_cli.wire.types`, as a replacement of `kimi_cli.wire.message`\nL753:   * Loop: Add `max_ralph_iterations` loop control config to limit extra Ralph iterations\nL754:   * Config: Rename `max_steps_per_run` to `max_steps_per_turn` in loop control config (backward-compatible)\nL755:   * CLI: Add `--max-steps-per-turn`, `--max-retries-per-step` and `--max-ralph-iterations` options to override loop control config\nL756:   * SlashCmd: Make `/yolo` toggle auto-approve mode\nL757:   * UI: Show a YOLO badge in the shell prompt\nL758: ## 0.72 (2026-01-04)\nL759: \nL760:   * Python: Fix installation on Python 3.14.\nL761: ## 0.71 (2026-01-04)\nL762: \nL763:   * ACP: Route file reads/writes and shell commands through ACP clients for synced edits/output\nL764:   * Shell: Add `/model` slash command to switch default models and reload when using the default config\nL765:   * Skills: Add `/skill:<name>` slash commands to load `SKILL.md` instructions on demand\nL766:   * CLI: Add `kimi info` subcommand for version/protocol details (supports `--json`)\nL767:   * CLI: Add `kimi term` to launch the Toad terminal UI\nL768:   * Python: Bump the default tooling/CI version to 3.14\nL769: ## 0.70 (2025-12-31)\nL770: \nL771:   * CLI: Add `--final-message-only` (and `--quiet` alias) to only output the final assistant message in print UI\nL772:   * LLM: Add `video_in` model capability and support video inputs\nL773: ## 0.69 (2025-12-29)\nL774: \nL775:   * Core: Support discovering skills in `~/.kimi/skills` or `~/.claude/skills`\nL776:   * Python: Lower the minimum required Python version to 3.12\nL777:   * Nix: Add flake packaging; install with `nix profile install .#kimi-cli` or run `nix run .#kimi-cli`\nL778:   * CLI: Add `kimi-cli` script alias for invoking the CLI; can be run via `uvx kimi-cli`\nL779:   * Lib: Move LLM config validation into `create_llm` and return `None` when missing config\nL780: ## 0.68 (2025-12-24)\nL781:   * CLI: Add `--config` and `--config-file` options to pass in config JSON/TOML\nL782:   * Core: Allow `Config` in addition to `Path` for the `config` parameter of `KimiCLI.create`\nL783:   * Tool: Include diff display blocks in `WriteFile` and `StrReplaceFile` approvals/results\nL784:   * Wire: Add display blocks to approval requests (including diffs) with backward-compatible defaults\nL785:   * ACP: Show file diff previews in tool results and approval prompts\nL786:   * ACP: Connect to MCP servers managed by ACP clients\nL787:   * ACP: Run shell commands in ACP client terminal if supported\nL788:   * Lib: Add `KimiToolset.find` method to find tools by class or name\nL789:   * Lib: Add `ToolResultBuilder.display` method to append display blocks to tool results\nL790:   * MCP: Add `kimi mcp auth` and related subcommands to manage MCP authorization\nL791: ## 0.67 (2025-12-22)\nL792: \nL793:   * ACP: Advertise slash commands in single-session ACP mode (`kimi --acp`)\nL794:   * MCP: Add `mcp.client` config section to configure MCP tool call timeout and other future options\nL795:   * Core: Improve default system prompt and `ReadFile` tool\nL796:   * UI: Fix Ctrl-C not working in some rare cases\nL797: ## 0.66 (2025-12-19)\nL798:   * Lib: Provide `token_usage` and `message_id` in `StatusUpdate` Wire message\nL799:   * Lib: Add `KimiToolset.load_tools` method to load tools with dependency injection\nL800:   * Lib: Add `KimiToolset.load_mcp_tools` method to load MCP tools\nL801:   * Lib: Move `MCPTool` from `kimi_cli.tools.mcp` to `kimi_cli.soul.toolset`\nL802:   * Lib: Add `InvalidToolError`, `MCPConfigError` and `MCPRuntimeError`\nL803:   * Lib: Make the detailed Kimi Code CLI exception classes extend `ValueError` or `RuntimeError`\nL804:   * Lib: Allow passing validated `list[fastmcp.mcp_config.MCPConfig]` as `mcp_configs` for `KimiCLI.create` and `load_agent`\nL805:   * Lib: Fix exception raising for `KimiCLI.create`, `load_agent`, `KimiToolset.load_tools` and `KimiToolset.load_mcp_tools`\nL806:   * LLM: Add provider type `vertexai` to support Vertex AI\nL807:   * LLM: Rename Gemini Developer API provider type from `google_genai` to `gemini`\nL808:   * Config: Migrate config file from JSON to TOML\nL809:   * MCP: Connect to MCP servers in background and parallel to reduce startup time\nL810:   * MCP: Add `mcp-session-id` HTTP header when connecting to MCP servers\nL811:   * Lib: Split slash commands (prev \"meta commands\") into two groups: Shell-level and KimiSoul-level\nL812:   * Lib: Add `available_slash_commands` property to `Soul` protocol\nL813:   * ACP: Advertise slash commands `/init`, `/compact` and `/yolo` to ACP clients\nL814:   * SlashCmd: Add `/mcp` slash command to display MCP server and tool status\nL815: ## 0.65 (2025-12-16)\nL816: \nL817:   * Lib: Support creating named sessions via `Session.create(work_dir, session_id)`\nL818:   * CLI: Automatically create new session when specified session ID is not found\nL819:   * CLI: Delete empty sessions on exit and ignore sessions whose context file is empty when listing\nL820:   * UI: Improve session replaying\nL821:   * Lib: Add `model_config: LLMModel | None` and `provider_config: LLMProvider | None` properties to `LLM` class\nL822:   * MetaCmd: Add `/usage` meta command to show API usage for Kimi Code users\nL823: ## 0.64 (2025-12-15)\nL824: \nL825:   * UI: Fix UTF-16 surrogate characters input on Windows\nL826:   * Core: Add `/sessions` meta command to list existing sessions and switch to a selected one\nL827:   * CLI: Add `--session/-S` option to specify session ID to resume\nL828:   * MCP: Add `kimi mcp` subcommand group to manage global MCP config file `~/.kimi/mcp.json`\nL829: ## 0.63 (2025-12-12)\nL830:   * Tool: Fix `FetchURL` tool incorrect output when fetching via service fails\nL831:   * Tool: Use `bash` instead of `sh` in `Shell` tool for better compatibility\nL832:   * Tool: Fix `Grep` tool unicode decoding error on Windows\nL833:   * ACP: Support ACP session continuation (list/load sessions) with `kimi acp` subcommand\nL834:   * Lib: Add `Session.find` and `Session.list` static methods to find and list sessions\nL835:   * ACP: Update agent plans on the client side when `SetTodoList` tool is called\nL836:   * UI: Prevent normal messages starting with `/` from being treated as meta commands\nL837: ## 0.62 (2025-12-08)\nL838:   * ACP: Fix tool results (including Shell tool output) not being displayed in ACP clients like Zed\nL839:   * ACP: Fix compatibility with the latest version of Zed IDE (0.215.3)\nL840:   * Tool: Use PowerShell instead of CMD on Windows for better usability\nL841:   * Core: Fix startup crash when there is broken symbolic link in the working directory\nL842:   * Core: Add builtin `okabe` agent file with `SendDMail` tool enabled\nL843:   * CLI: Add `--agent` option to specify builtin agents like `default` and `okabe`\nL844:   * Core: Improve compaction logic to better preserve relevant information\nL845: ## 0.61 (2025-12-04)\nL846: \nL847:   * Lib: Fix logging when used as a library\nL848:   * Tool: Harden file path check to protect against shared-prefix escape\nL849:   * LLM: Improve compatibility with some third-party OpenAI Responses and Anthropic API providers\nL850: \nL851: ## 0.60 (2025-12-01)\nL852: \nL853:   * LLM: Fix interleaved thinking for Kimi and OpenAI-compatible providers\nL854: ## 0.59 (2025-11-28)\nL855:   * Core: Move context file location to `.kimi/sessions/{workdir_md5}/{session_id}/context.jsonl`\nL856:   * Lib: Move `WireMessage` type alias to `kimi_cli.wire.message`\nL857:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.wire.message.Request` type alias request messages (which currently only includes `ApprovalRequest`)\nL858:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.wire.message.is_event`, `is_request` and `is_wire_message` utility functions to check the type of wire messages\nL859:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.wire.serde` module for serialization and deserialization of wire messages\nL860:   * Lib: Change `StatusUpdate` Wire message to not using `kimi_cli.soul.StatusSnapshot`\nL861:   * Core: Record Wire messages to a JSONL file in session directory\nL862:   * Core: Introduce `TurnBegin` Wire message to mark the beginning of each agent turn\nL863:   * UI: Print user input again with a panel in shell mode\nL864:   * Lib: Add `Session.dir` property to get the session directory path\nL865:   * UI: Improve \"Approve for session\" experience when there are multiple parallel subagents\nL866:   * Wire: Reimplement Wire server mode (which is enabled with `--wire` option)\nL867:   * Lib: Rename `ShellApp` to `Shell`, `PrintApp` to `Print`, `ACPServer` to `ACP` and `WireServer` to `WireOverStdio` for better consistency\nL868:   * Lib: Rename `KimiCLI.run_shell_mode` to `run_shell`, `run_print_mode` to `run_print`, `run_acp_server` to `run_acp`, and `run_wire_server` to `run_wire_stdio` for better consistency\nL869:   * Lib: Add `KimiCLI.run` method to run a turn with given user input and yield Wire messages\nL870:   * Print: Fix stream-json print mode not flushing output properly\nL871:   * LLM: Improve compatibility with some OpenAI and Anthropic API providers\nL872:   * Core: Fix chat provider error after compaction when using Anthropic API\nL873: ## 0.58 (2025-11-21)\nL874: \nL875:   * Core: Fix field inheritance of agent spec files when using `extend`\nL876:   * Core: Support using MCP tools in subagents\nL877:   * Tool: Add `CreateSubagent` tool to create subagents dynamically (not enabled in default agent)\nL878:   * Tool: Use MoonshotFetch service in `FetchURL` tool for Kimi Code plan\nL879:   * Tool: Truncate Grep tool output to avoid exceeding token limit\nL880: ## 0.57 (2025-11-20)\nL881: \nL882:   * LLM: Fix Google GenAI provider when thinking toggle is not on\nL883:   * UI: Improve approval request wordings\nL884:   * Tool: Remove `PatchFile` tool\nL885:   * Tool: Rename `Bash`/`CMD` tool to `Shell` tool\nL886:   * Tool: Move `Task` tool to `kimi_cli.tools.multiagent` module\nL887: \nL888: ## 0.56 (2025-11-19)\nL889: \nL890:   * LLM: Add support for Google GenAI provider\nL891: ## 0.55 (2025-11-18)\nL892:   * Lib: Add `kimi_cli.app.enable_logging` function to enable logging when directly using `KimiCLI` class\nL893:   * Core: Fix relative path resolution in agent spec files\nL894:   * Core: Prevent from panic when LLM API connection failed\nL895:   * Tool: Optimize `FetchURL` tool for better content extraction\nL896:   * Tool: Increase MCP tool call timeout to 60 seconds\nL897:   * Tool: Provide better error message in `Glob` tool when pattern is `**`\nL898:   * ACP: Fix thinking content not displayed properly\nL899:   * UI: Minor UI improvements in shell mode\nL900: ## 0.54 (2025-11-13)\nL901: \nL902:   * Lib: Move `WireMessage` from `kimi_cli.wire.message` to `kimi_cli.wire`\nL903:   * Print: Fix `stream-json` output format missing the last assistant message\nL904:   * UI: Add warning when API key is overridden by `KIMI_API_KEY` environment variable\nL905:   * UI: Make a bell sound when there's an approval request\nL906:   * Core: Fix context compaction and clearing on Windows\nL907: ## 0.53 (2025-11-12)\nL908: \nL909:   * UI: Remove unnecessary trailing spaces in console output\nL910:   * Core: Throw error when there are unsupported message parts\nL911:   * MetaCmd: Add `/yolo` meta command to enable YOLO mode after startup\nL912:   * Tool: Add approval request for MCP tools\nL913:   * Tool: Disable `Think` tool in default agent\nL914:   * CLI: Restore thinking mode from last time when `--thinking` is not specified\nL915:   * CLI: Fix `/reload` not working in binary packed by PyInstaller\n"
